<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 344.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 344.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 344.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	 4.5	     4.5		    7.50</p>
<p>    26 weeks	47.25	   47.25		   8.00</p>
<p>    52 weeks     117.75	  117.75		  8.50</p>
<p>    Five years	35		35		    9.50</p>
<p>    10-years	  70		70		   10.00</p>
<p>    15-years	  70		70</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    344.5	  344.5</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for May 19, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.4 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
